.nh
.TH "PB-CONFIG-REPOSITORY-LIST" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-config-repository-list - List connected repositories


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb config repository list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List connected repositories

.PP
List the connected repositories available to your signed-in account, including their stable IDs, display names, and providers. Use the stable repository ID when names are ambiguous or when scripting later configuration commands.

.PP
Configuration commands distinguish local CLI settings from synchronized repository content. Inspect current state before changing it; synchronization reports conflicts instead of silently overwriting one side. The --json option provides structured output for scripts where supported.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-config-repository(1)\fP
